WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:08.200
One objective asks Pi to implement repository-scoped read authorization.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Pi consults Decapod’s repository instructions.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Pi claims the task and enters a governed worktree.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Decapod returns a failed required check and blocks publication.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:59.500
Missing repository grant. Expected false, observed true.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Pi investigates and edits src/access.cjs to require the repository grant.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:49.500
Fresh validation binds the passing checks to the repaired commit.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Pi invokes Decapod’s workspace publisher with the validated changes.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:29.500
GitHub PR #7 has the exact validated head and accepted base. Admission grants no merge authorization.
